WEBVTT

00:10.020 --> 00:13.903
There, you'll learn parts about him unknown to you,
and learn more about yourself.

00:14.529 --> 00:18.621
And he will also gain a deeper understanding of you,
and reexamine his own past.

00:18.746 --> 00:19.790
In other words...

00:19.790 --> 00:20.583
Eep!

00:21.292 --> 00:22.963
...you'll find out!

00:23.380 --> 00:25.969
Why Andy was born, that is!

00:42.042 --> 00:46.467
Right now, Andy is experiencing another life.

00:46.844 --> 00:51.854
A hypothetical one where
he first met you long, long ago.

00:52.772 --> 00:55.193
Of course, this won't alter his actual life.

00:55.570 --> 00:59.201
But the memories of what-if
will remain with him all the same.

00:59.703 --> 01:03.669
And I'm positive those memories
will strengthen his heart.

01:04.629 --> 01:06.717
So if you interrupt this,
I'll have to kill you...

01:07.259 --> 01:08.512
...my little guests from Under.

02:49.756 --> 02:52.929
<i>Fuko arrives at Andy's oldest memory.</i>

02:52.929 --> 02:57.772
<i>There, she encounters Victor,
the personality that originally inhabited Andy's body.</i>

02:58.189 --> 03:03.199
<i>Victor tries to regain his body from Andy
by eradicating Fuko's soul within his memories.</i>

03:03.408 --> 03:07.040
<i>Murdered multiple times,
Fuko is cornered at the final chapter of memories.</i>

03:07.124 --> 03:09.754
<i>But the one that came to save her
from peril was none other than Andy,</i>

03:09.796 --> 03:13.094
<i>who had powered up after his views on death changed.</i>

03:13.512 --> 03:16.267
<i>Andy and Victor fight in the memory realm.</i>

03:16.350 --> 03:21.444
<i>In the fierce exchange of techniques,
Andy had gained power equal to even Victor.</i>

03:21.695 --> 03:25.828
<i>He creates a new technique "Unluck Bullet"
which combines his own Undead powers</i>

03:25.828 --> 03:29.418
<i>with Fuko's Unluck powers to strike back at Victor.</i>

03:29.794 --> 03:33.844
<i>At the end of the stormy battle,
Victor sees hope within Fuko's Unluck powers.</i>

03:34.219 --> 03:37.059
<i>He entrusts them to head into the battle against God.</i>

03:37.727 --> 03:41.400
<i>Fuko's return to reality begins by a kiss with Andy.</i>

03:41.400 --> 03:46.787
<i>The expansive book of past memories close,
and a new page begins to be written.</i>

03:57.767 --> 04:02.735
We want to learn about the future.
The part that you didn't draw out, that is.

04:03.069 --> 04:08.329
You better talk unless you want those two
you're desperately protecting to get all chopped up.

04:08.664 --> 04:09.874
I decline!

04:14.341 --> 04:15.886
Sean... not yet.

04:16.429 --> 04:17.472
No way.

04:19.268 --> 04:24.696
If I kill that brat,
then I'll get a seat higher than yours in Under.

04:25.113 --> 04:29.664
<i>I'm over taking orders
from the guy who sliced open my stomach.</i>

04:34.381 --> 04:40.143
You already know the past and the end, right?
What good will saving those two do you?

04:40.351 --> 04:43.483
Saving? Hah, not quite!

04:43.734 --> 04:44.903
I see...

04:51.958 --> 04:54.964
Their existence is the reason I'm alive!

05:00.518 --> 05:03.314
That's why this time... I'm going to save them!

05:05.528 --> 05:10.538
A STORY I WON'T SEE COMING

05:12.917 --> 05:16.215
<i>Akira Kuno was raised by a single mother.</i>

05:17.175 --> 05:20.348
<i>A peculiar child who would have
his mother read him manga at bedtime.</i>

05:21.935 --> 05:27.028
<i>But before long, his mother instead listened
to tales from her son's imagination.</i>

05:29.157 --> 05:32.874
<i>He created the characters, plotted the stories,
and drew the pictures.</i>

05:34.001 --> 05:38.802
<i>He loved how his stories put
a smile on his mother's face.</i>

05:45.273 --> 05:46.108
Oh?

05:47.737 --> 05:50.491
Wow! A G-pen!

06:03.518 --> 06:07.317
<i>The name of that Artifact is G-Liner.</i>

06:07.985 --> 06:14.414
<i>The first to touch it can see the past
and future events of the current time loop in its entirety.</i>

06:15.542 --> 06:20.803
<i>At that moment, all of the memories
of this loop flooded into Akira Kuno's mind.</i>

06:20.886 --> 06:23.642
Wow! What is this amazing story?

06:24.101 --> 06:27.900
"Negators"? "UMA"? "Artifacts"?

06:28.401 --> 06:31.574
What an amazing sci-fi spectacle!

06:31.825 --> 06:35.164
I can't waste time standing here!
I need to hurry and talk to Mom!

06:36.751 --> 06:37.670
Gah!

06:39.674 --> 06:44.726
I'm very sorry for bumping into you, Mister!
I guess I got too excited for my own good!

06:52.365 --> 06:53.284
Huh?

06:54.579 --> 06:58.545
<i>And at the same time,
he was chosen as a Negator.</i>

06:59.672 --> 07:03.597
Gotta draw the characters while I can!
Then I'll show 'em to Mom!

07:03.847 --> 07:07.479
I wonder who she'll like best?
Maybe Rip?

07:07.605 --> 07:10.234
As for me, it's gotta be...

07:10.234 --> 07:12.197
Oh! She's back!

07:12.782 --> 07:17.248
I'm back! I ended up grabbing
takeout for dinner! Sorry!

07:17.415 --> 07:19.211
Mom! Check these out!

07:19.712 --> 07:23.553
I drew a whole bunch of cool guys!
I'll give you this one.

07:24.012 --> 07:25.849
He's called Rip and he's-

07:25.849 --> 07:27.393
Akira!

07:27.812 --> 07:30.984
I've got croquettes from the butcher!

07:33.447 --> 07:35.536
They'll get cold!

07:42.465 --> 07:46.558
<i>Akira Kuno... Compulsory Activation-Type Negator.</i>

07:48.687 --> 07:52.277
Yes... that's right!
I can't find him anywhere!

07:52.820 --> 07:55.408
He's not at any of his friends' houses, either!

07:55.408 --> 07:59.876
I'm begging you!
My child... my child...

08:00.084 --> 08:02.005
Please find him!

08:03.465 --> 08:08.852
<i>At all times, Akira's speech and conduct,
or any external changes made thereof...</i>

08:09.269 --> 08:10.731
I beg of you!

08:10.731 --> 08:14.154
<i>...went completely undetected by any other living being.</i>

08:14.864 --> 08:16.325
<i>No matter how hard he tried to yell...</i>

08:16.784 --> 08:18.162
<i>No matter how much he tried to touch...</i>

08:18.622 --> 08:20.249
<i>Not a single person noticed him.</i>

08:20.249 --> 08:23.840
Please... find Akira... my child!

08:28.558 --> 08:30.144
Where are you?

08:30.144 --> 08:31.564
I'm right here...

08:31.564 --> 08:33.400
Are you alive?

08:33.400 --> 08:34.946
I'm alive.

08:36.490 --> 08:40.666
God... Please, I beg of you...

08:42.628 --> 08:47.888
Please let Akira be alive somewhere...
with a smile on his face.

08:49.432 --> 08:54.359
Please let him continue to draw...
the manga that he loves so much.

09:08.763 --> 09:12.563
AKIRA KUNO

09:13.314 --> 09:14.316
Okay.

09:17.030 --> 09:21.998
<i>I'm most likely a Negator,
and this ability will stay with me until I die.</i>

09:23.167 --> 09:25.756
<i>Then should I just die?</i>

09:26.131 --> 09:27.175
<i>I shouldn't.</i>

09:30.849 --> 09:33.772
<i>From the story that rushed into
my brain on that day...</i>

09:34.356 --> 09:37.236
<i>...my favorite characters were Andy and Fuko.</i>

09:37.780 --> 09:42.163
<i>They didn't run away from their abilities.
They fought to the very end.</i>

09:48.760 --> 09:52.141
<i>So I'll fight, too.
I'll draw manga!</i>

09:52.768 --> 09:55.064
<i>For my mom who wishes me to do so!</i>

09:56.066 --> 09:59.532
<i>And so that one day,
everyone can learn of...</i>

09:59.532 --> 10:02.161
<i>...the actions of the people who taught me this bravery!</i>

10:07.004 --> 10:11.889
<i>I practiced a lot
and drew a one-shot to submit.</i>

10:13.225 --> 10:19.655
<i>I debated using Andy and the gang's tale,
but I first wanted to try penning my own story.</i>

10:20.322 --> 10:22.828
<i>The title is "To You, From Me."</i>

10:22.911 --> 10:23.913
TO YOU, FROM ME

10:23.997 --> 10:26.168
<i>An ordinary, naive romance manga.</i>

10:26.878 --> 10:32.013
A pen name, huh? Well, no one's going
to read it anyway, so I can pick whatever.

10:35.478 --> 10:38.651
Nobody (UN) knows (KNOWN)...

10:39.653 --> 10:42.701
Anno Un.

10:43.243 --> 10:44.245
There!

10:44.914 --> 10:47.878
WE HAVE A WINNER!
GRAND PRIZE, ONE MILLION YEN

10:48.128 --> 10:48.880
Huh?

10:50.132 --> 10:57.773
"Winner Anno... there was no contact info.
Please contact us ASAP."

10:58.398 --> 11:00.987
"We plan to serialize your submission right away..."

11:02.991 --> 11:13.011
<i>As Anno Un... as long as I don't draw anything
tying them to Akira Kuno, I...</i>

11:14.472 --> 11:15.725
TO YOU, FROM ME

11:16.101 --> 11:17.311
<i>I can get everyone to...</i>

11:18.731 --> 11:20.276
<i>...know me!</i>

11:20.735 --> 11:24.702
HOSPITAL

11:25.244 --> 11:30.714
This is all the rage nowadays!
"You-Me"! Would you like to read, too, Ms. Kuno?

11:34.470 --> 11:35.515
Oh my...

11:38.478 --> 11:40.232
The art's quite lovely.

11:54.010 --> 11:56.056
"TO YOU, FROM ME" - ANNO UN
NOW ON SALE! - SHUEISHA

11:57.893 --> 12:00.189
SHUEISHA - EDITORIAL DEPARTMENT 3
Don't you think we run out
of erasers faster lately?

12:00.439 --> 12:01.859
Yeah.

12:01.859 --> 12:04.405
<i>A while after I got serialized...</i>

12:05.157 --> 12:09.750
<i>...I recalled and thought of my memories.</i>

12:13.841 --> 12:19.018
<i>I thought about those two
and their story. Were they all true?</i>

12:20.145 --> 12:24.738
Well, it sure felt real.
But still, I just can't believe...

12:27.034 --> 12:27.994
Oh, yeah...

12:28.203 --> 12:34.967
Come to think, Andy was in Japan this August
to learn quick-draw sword techniques.

12:45.989 --> 12:51.374
<i>If I miss this chance, Andy wouldn't be back
in Japan until August of 2020.</i>

12:52.293 --> 12:57.929
<i>I was still skeptical, but I relied on my memories
and rushed off to where he would be.</i>

12:59.348 --> 13:02.104
Man, I need to exercise more...

13:05.737 --> 13:06.697
Whoa!

13:17.009 --> 13:21.184
Well done. That is the Gekkou Moonlight-style
quick-draw slash, Waxing Moon!

13:23.523 --> 13:25.902
<i>It was... all real!</i>

13:26.529 --> 13:29.367
Here's your Japanese quick-draw, Josh.

13:29.743 --> 13:32.081
Andy is here, right before my very eyes!

13:32.791 --> 13:35.295
A-A...

13:36.841 --> 13:41.307
Andy!

13:43.019 --> 13:46.150
Welp, it's been fun.
Later, Yusai.

13:46.484 --> 13:47.111
Wait!

13:47.946 --> 13:50.409
You've mastered all our arts
in just one short year.

13:50.409 --> 13:53.164
I will not let such immense talent slip away!

13:53.164 --> 13:56.881
Don't you think fate meant
for this to happen? Please, stay here!

13:59.093 --> 14:04.061
And, um... I want an heir to continue our legacy!

14:04.061 --> 14:07.276
I'm sure my late father would be pleased, indeed!

14:09.071 --> 14:10.198
Sick.

14:10.575 --> 14:13.246
Hold on! You already have Fuko,
don't you, Andy?

14:13.998 --> 14:16.336
If you can outlive me, that is.

14:21.095 --> 14:22.222
See ya around.

14:22.974 --> 14:24.268
<i>That's right...</i>

14:24.937 --> 14:27.024
<i>Negators are suffering.</i>

14:28.193 --> 14:30.197
<i>The same went for all of the others, too.</i>

14:31.867 --> 14:37.169
<i>They agonized and struggled with Negator powers
so unreasonably thrust upon them...</i>

14:37.629 --> 14:40.050
<i>But they still fought to kill God!</i>

14:41.177 --> 14:47.314
<i>However, if these memories are correct...
I already know.</i>

14:48.400 --> 14:52.909
<i>...They will lose by losing Andy and Fuko!</i>

14:53.869 --> 14:57.209
<i>Should that be allowed to happen?
Of course not!</i>

14:57.711 --> 14:59.296
<i>None of the others know of this fact!</i>

15:00.007 --> 15:02.679
<i>The only one who does know is me,
of all people.</i>

15:03.304 --> 15:08.189
<i>No. They dared to choose me to toy with us.</i>

15:08.314 --> 15:11.320
<i>Is there some way? Any way?</i>

15:11.822 --> 15:16.832
<i>Nobody can know about me. But there must be
a way so I can relay the future to them!</i>

15:18.418 --> 15:21.049
TO YOU, FROM ME

15:23.053 --> 15:24.514
That's it... manga!

15:26.225 --> 15:31.360
<i>Under the name Anno Un, I can get my work out
to the world. It's a loophole in the rules!</i>

15:31.486 --> 15:35.160
<i>By using this,
I can jot down details about the future.</i>

15:37.582 --> 15:41.464
<i>But... is this really the best I can do?</i>

15:41.924 --> 15:47.434
<i>If I recreated everything as is,
wouldn't it also halt any growth they're supposed to have?</i>

15:48.103 --> 15:54.783
<i>Driven by a range of feelings,
they are all risking their lives, learning, and growing.</i>

15:55.743 --> 16:00.293
<i>Be it Andy's past,
or the details behind Billy's betrayal.</i>

16:01.420 --> 16:05.262
<i>There is meaning in the process of knowing.
I need to pick the right stories!</i>

16:05.805 --> 16:08.727
<i>To change the future for the best!</i>

16:13.571 --> 16:15.115
<i>My top priority will be the Autumn battle.</i>

16:15.992 --> 16:18.956
<i>This is the branching point...
a single, solitary oversight!</i>

16:22.714 --> 16:25.511
<i>It will be the one thing I will make sure to change!</i>

16:27.264 --> 16:29.519
<i>And to do so,
I'll collect everything I need!</i>

16:30.103 --> 16:32.482
Hey, where's the encyclopedia that was here?

16:32.482 --> 16:34.236
Great, you lost it again?

16:34.403 --> 16:36.073
It wasn't me this time!

16:36.783 --> 16:38.411
<i>Everyone else is working hard!</i>

16:40.833 --> 16:43.087
<i>And I'm a Negator like them!</i>

16:46.970 --> 16:49.058
<i>So this time,
I'll be the one to help them!</i>

16:54.318 --> 16:58.284
<i>X-Day-the day it all happens-
December 5th, 2020.</i>

16:58.284 --> 17:01.332
<i>Today, on this very day,
this very moment!</i>

17:01.792 --> 17:03.336
I'll go for her throat!

17:06.092 --> 17:07.887
Andy! Deadline, now!

17:10.893 --> 17:12.145
Deadline!

17:17.197 --> 17:19.911
<i>December 5th, 2020.</i>

17:20.579 --> 17:26.883
<i>In the future Akira Kuno saw,
while battling Autumn with Anno Un absent...</i>

17:27.217 --> 17:31.977
<i>Unseen's invisible deadly blade
had killed Fuko Izumo.</i>

17:32.854 --> 17:33.689
<i>However, now...</i>

17:39.408 --> 17:40.410
Uh...

17:40.410 --> 17:41.622
Sensei!

17:44.293 --> 17:45.420
Your right arm is also-

17:45.713 --> 17:46.548
Urp!

17:46.840 --> 17:47.759
Fuko.

17:50.096 --> 17:50.973
Who...?

17:51.767 --> 17:56.233
This is Unseen.
The Negator that got taken by Under.

17:56.902 --> 18:00.492
And based on where he's standin',
I'm certain he was aimin' to kill you.

18:01.410 --> 18:04.458
If Anno hadn't spoken up,
things would've been a lot worse.

18:04.876 --> 18:08.132
So get over it.
I taught ya in the book, didn't I?

18:09.761 --> 18:11.305
You forget already?

18:17.025 --> 18:18.695
Hell of a journey, wasn't it?

18:18.695 --> 18:19.572
Yeah!

18:20.950 --> 18:22.411
I did it!

18:27.588 --> 18:31.555
From here on out
is a story I won't see coming.

20:05.534 --> 20:06.953
Backs. You take Unluck!

20:06.953 --> 20:10.502
Qwit callin' me Backs!
It's not cute!

20:11.378 --> 20:15.136
That's a weal pwetty gun you got!
Now, give it to Bunny!

20:15.428 --> 20:17.432
A rabbit? Do I shoot?

20:17.975 --> 20:18.769
<i>No...</i>

20:19.353 --> 20:20.981
<i>If they're a Negator, too, then...</i>

20:21.357 --> 20:23.486
<i>...I can't stay passive!</i>

20:28.538 --> 20:29.498
Fweh.

20:29.791 --> 20:32.672
Sorry! I don't think a big stroke
of unluck'll come though!

20:32.838 --> 20:36.428
Wah! She slapped me, agoo!

20:36.428 --> 20:38.099
Rip-woo!

20:38.099 --> 20:40.896
I managed to steal it, doe!

20:41.313 --> 20:42.858
I won, agoo!

20:43.694 --> 20:44.654
My gun...

20:47.200 --> 20:51.125
Fwee! All done-got da gun, a...

20:51.125 --> 20:52.712
...goo! Rip-woo!

20:52.712 --> 20:53.755
Are you all right?

20:55.676 --> 20:57.930
Still too early for Bunny, too, huh?

20:57.930 --> 21:00.602
First Sean, now this.
Nothing's going right.

21:00.936 --> 21:03.942
Well, I guess it's easier to handle it on my own.

21:07.031 --> 21:09.494
Why don't we work together to catch Autumn?

21:09.494 --> 21:10.413
Pardon?

21:10.413 --> 21:12.250
We're all Negators here.

21:12.250 --> 21:15.632
Isn't our true goal to kill God?

21:16.008 --> 21:19.097
I'm sure it's better to help each other!

21:21.519 --> 21:27.447
But for that, we need to catch Autumn,
strive to clear the four quests, and-

21:27.447 --> 21:30.203
Killing God is the Boss's goal.

21:30.579 --> 21:34.252
Creed's is to take control of nations.
Feng's is collecting Artifacts.

21:34.461 --> 21:38.845
Latla and I want Ark,
that your boss supposedly has.

21:39.262 --> 21:45.441
Our goals are all different. Only when our interests align,
we come together and cooperate.

21:45.609 --> 21:48.280
That's how we operate-that's Under.

21:49.074 --> 21:53.542
If you can give us any info on Ark,
then sure, we can fight together.

21:53.875 --> 21:56.548
But if you can't,
then you're in the way and you die here.

21:56.840 --> 22:01.056
Ark? Isn't that the thing
Ms. Juiz used for the Loop?

22:01.056 --> 22:02.601
Why are you so fixated on tha-

22:02.601 --> 22:05.481
You should give up on that idea.
I already know.

22:06.024 --> 22:08.947
Neither you, nor Latla,
can ride Ark.

22:10.826 --> 22:11.619
Huh...?

22:11.786 --> 22:15.418
That's not all.
You'll end up losing Latla as well.

22:21.848 --> 22:24.645
Her life was repairable.

22:26.566 --> 22:28.778
That's why I'm going to use
Ark to redo things.

22:29.237 --> 22:32.452
For her, I'm willing to risk it all!

22:32.828 --> 22:38.047
Both legs... the rest of my life span...
even the lives of others!

22:38.757 --> 22:41.888
If you get that,
then step back and leave Autumn for us to take-

22:41.888 --> 22:43.683
I'm the same way!

22:43.683 --> 22:46.940
Don't try to hog all the spotlight
for yourself, Rip!

22:47.440 --> 22:51.741
If it means saving her,
then I'll do whatever it takes, too!

22:52.367 --> 22:55.582
Yeah... that's right, Latla.

22:55.582 --> 22:58.254
Oh? Big Sissy Latla is here, agoo?

23:00.634 --> 23:02.680
Autumn is heading your way right now!

23:02.680 --> 23:05.351
I think it's being drawn to that big book
that was just there!

23:05.602 --> 23:07.773
What's the plan?
Do we deal with it here?

23:08.148 --> 23:09.234
Yeah.

23:16.248 --> 23:19.045
- Autumn... is ours!
- Autumn... is ours!

23:19.045 --> 23:24.055
TO BE CONTINUED

23:24.097 --> 23:25.266
PREVIEW

23:32.363 --> 23:35.537
"TO YOU, FROM ME"
